WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.667 --> 00:00:20.999
Theo: I can't believe school is over.

2
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:24.872
Skyler: Now we have all summer to play with our pets!

3
00:00:24.873 --> 00:00:26.274
Ben: I don't.

4
00:00:26.275 --> 00:00:29.951
Riley: What do you mean, Ben?

5
00:00:29.952 --> 00:00:33.837
Ben: My family is taking a train trip.

6
00:00:33.838 --> 00:00:36.125
Sarah: That's exciting!

7
00:00:36.126 --> 00:00:39.181
Ben: There's only one bad thing.

8
00:00:39.182 --> 00:00:41.161
Riley: What's that?

9
00:00:41.162 --> 00:00:44.090
Ben: No pets are allowed on the train.

10
00:00:44.091 --> 00:00:48.332
Speedy can't come with us!

11
00:00:48.333 --> 00:00:50.681
Riley: Don't worry, Ben.

12
00:00:50.682 --> 00:00:54.602
We'll take care of Speedy for you.

13
00:00:54.603 --> 00:00:56.938
Skyler: He can stay at my house.

14
00:00:56.939 --> 00:00:59.159
That will be fun for him.

15
00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.325
Chatter: Fun, fun, fun!

16
00:01:01.326 --> 00:01:07.400
Ben: Thanks! I just wish Speedy could come on the train.

17
00:01:07.401 --> 00:01:10.435
Theo: Hey, I have an idea.

18
00:01:10.436 --> 00:01:12.432
Riley: What is it?

19
00:01:12.433 --> 00:01:16.068
Theo: I have an electric train set in my room.

20
00:01:16.069 --> 00:01:19.158
Theo: Let's give our pets a train ride.

21
00:01:19.159 --> 00:01:21.620
Sarah: That's a great idea!

22
00:01:21.621 --> 00:01:26.759
Riley: Let's go!

23
00:01:26.760 --> 00:01:28.968
Theo: Here's my train.

24
00:01:28.969 --> 00:01:31.466
Ben: What a great train set.

25
00:01:31.467 --> 00:01:34.944
Sarah: It has towns and bridges.

26
00:01:34.945 --> 00:01:42.138
Theo: You flip a switch and the train goes around. See?

27
00:01:42.139 --> 00:01:43.966
Chatter: Woo, woo!

28
00:01:43.967 --> 00:01:46.662
Snooks: Ar-ooo!

29
00:01:46.663 --> 00:01:53.446
Riley: Sorry, Snooks. You're too big to go on the train.

30
00:01:53.447 --> 00:01:55.819
Theo: Time for the ride!

31
00:01:55.820 --> 00:01:58.365
Hang on, Whiskers!

32
00:01:58.366 --> 00:02:00.157
Chatter: Woo, woo!

33
00:02:00.158 --> 00:02:02.729
Ben: Sit here, Speedy.

34
00:02:02.730 --> 00:02:06.624
Theo: Frankie can ride on the caboose.

35
00:02:06.625 --> 00:02:09.273
Sarah: Mittens will wait in the train station.

36
00:02:09.274 --> 00:02:20.362
Theo: All aboard! Here we go!
